      "media_slot_id": "I.1.still.profield-7",
      "heading": "5 · Read the circulation",
      "sentence": "The same picture can change when it moves from runway to retail to feed to gallery.",
      "quote": "Whether you’re burned out, starting out, starting over, or wildly successful, the question is always the same: How to keep going?",
